#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:3
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "Hisobot yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:5
msgid ""
"You can find several reports under the :guilabel:`Reporting` menu of most "
"apps that let you analyze and visualize the data of your records."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pchilik ilovalarning :guilabel:`Reporting` menyusi ostida yozuvlaringiz "
"ma'lumotlarini tahlil qilish va vizuallashtirish imkonini beruvchi bir "
"nechta hisobotlarni topishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:11
msgid "Selecting a view"
msgstr "Ko'rinishni tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:13
msgid ""
"Depending on the report, Odoo can display the data in various ways. "
"Sometimes, a unique view fully tailored to the report is available, while "
"several views are available for others. However, two generic views are "
"dedicated to reporting: the graph and pivot views."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotga qarab, Odoo ma'lumotlarni turli usullarda ko'rsatishi mumkin. "
"Ba'zan hisobotga to'liq moslashtirilgan yagona ko'rinish mavjud bo'lsa, "
"boshqalari uchun bir nechta ko'rinishlar mavjud. Biroq, ikkita umumiy "
"ko'rinish hisobot yaratishga bag'ishlangan: grafik va pivot ko'rinishlari."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:20
msgid "Graph view"
msgstr "Grafik ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:22
msgid ""
"The :ref:`graph view <reporting/using-graph>` is used to visualize your "
"records' data, helping you identify patterns and trends. The view is often "
"found under the :guilabel:`Reporting` menu of apps but can be found "
"elsewhere. Click the **graph view button** located at the top right to "
"access it."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Grafik ko'rinishi <reporting/using-graph>` yozuvlaringiz "
"ma'lumotlarini vizuallashtirish uchun ishlatiladi va qonuniyatlar hamda "
"tendensiyalarni aniqlashga yordam beradi. Bu ko'rinish odatda "
"ilovalarning :guilabel:`Reporting` menyusi ostida joylashgan, lekin boshqa "
"joylarda ham uchrashi mumkin. Unga kirish uchun yuqori o'ng burchakda "
"joylashgan **grafik ko'rinishi tugmasini** bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:None
msgid "Selecting the graph view"
msgstr "Grafik ko'rinishini tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:32
msgid "Pivot view"
msgstr "Pivot ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:34
msgid ""
"The :ref:`pivot view <reporting/using-pivot>` is used to aggregate your "
"records' data and break it down for analysis. The view is often found under "
"the :guilabel:`Reporting` menu of apps but can be found elsewhere. Click the "
"**pivot view button** located at the top right to access it."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Pivot ko'rinishi <reporting/using-pivot>` yozuvlaringiz ma'lumotlarini "
"jamlash va tahlil qilish uchun bo'laklarga ajratishda ishlatiladi. Bu "
"ko'rinish odatda ilovalarning :guilabel:`Reporting` menyusi ostida "
"joylashgan, lekin boshqa joylarda ham uchrashi mumkin. Unga kirish uchun "
"yuqori o'ng burchakda joylashgan **pivot ko'rinishi tugmasini** bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:None
msgid "Selecting the pivot view"
msgstr "Pivot ko'rinishini tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:44
msgid "Choosing measures"
msgstr "O'lchovlarni tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:46
msgid ""
"After selecting a view, you should ensure only the relevant records "
"are :doc:`filtered <search>`. Next, you should choose what is measured. By "
"default, a measure is always selected. If you wish to edit it, "
"click :guilabel:`Measures` and choose one or, only for pivots, multiple "
"measures."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rinishni tanlagandan so'ng, faqat tegishli yozuvlar :doc:`filtrlangani "
"<search>`ga ishonch hosil qilishingiz kerak. Keyin, nima o'lchanishini "
"tanlashingiz kerak. Standart holatda, har doim bitta o'lchov (measure) "
"tanlangan bo'ladi. Uni tahrirlashni istasangiz, :guilabel:`Measures` "
"tugmasini bosing va bitta yoki, faqat pivotlar uchun, bir nechta o'lchovni "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:51
msgid ""
"When you select a measure, Odoo aggregates the values recorded on that field "
"for the filtered records. Only numerical fields (:ref:`integer <studio/"
"fields/simple-fields-integer>`, :ref:`decimal <studio/fields/simple-fields-"
"decimal>`, :ref:`monetary <studio/fields/simple-fields-monetary>`) can be "
"measured. In addition, the :guilabel:`Count` option is used to count the "
"total number of filtered records."
msgstr ""
"O'lchovni tanlaganingizda, Odoo filtrlangan yozuvlar uchun o'sha maydonda "
"qayd etilgan qiymatlarni jamlaydi. Faqat raqamli maydonlar (:ref:`butun son "
"<studio/fields/simple-fields-integer>`, :ref:`o'nlik son <studio/fields/"
"simple-fields-decimal>`, :ref:`pul <studio/fields/simple-fields-monetary>`) "
"o'lchanishi mumkin. Bundan tashqari, :guilabel:`Count` opsiyasi filtrlangan "
"yozuvlarning umumiy sonini hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:57
msgid ""
"After choosing what you want to measure, you can define how the data should "
"be :ref:`grouped <search/group>` depending on the dimension you want to "
"analyze. By default, the data is often grouped by *Date > Month*, which is "
"used to analyze the evolution of a measure over the months."
msgstr ""
"Nimani o'lchashni tanlaganingizdan so'ng, tahlil qilmoqchi bo'lgan "
"o'lchamingizga qarab ma'lumotlar qanday :ref:`guruhlanishi <search/group>` "
"kerakligini belgilashingiz mumkin. Standart holatda, ma'lumotlar ko'pincha "
"*Sana > Oy* bo'yicha guruhlanadi va bu o'lchovning oylar davomidagi "
"o'zgarishini tahlil qilish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:65
msgid "Select measures"
msgstr "O'lchovlarni tanlang"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:67
msgid ""
"Among other measures, you could add the :guilabel:`Margin` "
"and :guilabel:`Count` measures to the Sales Analysis report. By default, "
"the :guilabel:`Untaxed Amount` measure is selected."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa o'lchovlar qatorida, Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotiga :guilabel:`Margin` "
"va :guilabel:`Count` o'lchovlarini qo'shishingiz mumkin. Standart "
"holatda, :guilabel:`Untaxed Amount` o'lchovi tanlangan bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Selecting different measures on the Sales Analysis report"
msgstr "Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotida turli o'lchovlarni tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:74
msgid "Group measures"
msgstr "O'lchovlarni guruhlash"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:76
msgid ""
"You could group the measures by :guilabel:`Product Category` at the level of "
"rows on the previous Sales Analysis report example."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi Sotuvlar tahlili hisoboti misolida o'lchovlarni qatorlar "
"darajasida :guilabel:`Product Category` bo'yicha guruhlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Adding a group on the Sales Analysis report"
msgstr "Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotiga guruh qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:85
msgid "Using the pivot view"
msgstr "Pivot ko'rinishidan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:87
msgid ""
"Grouping data is quintessential to the pivot view. It enables drilling down "
"the data to gain deeper insights. While you can use the :guilabel:`Group By` "
"option to quickly add a group at the level of rows, as shown in the example "
"above, you can also click the plus button (:guilabel:`➕`) next to "
"the :guilabel:`Total` header at the level of rows *and* columns, and then "
"select one of the **preconfigured groups**. To remove one, click the minus "
"button (:guilabel:`➖`)."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni guruhlash pivot ko'rinishining eng muhim jihati hisoblanadi. "
"Bu chuqurroq tahlil qilish uchun ma'lumotlarni batafsil ochib ko'rish "
"imkonini beradi. Yuqoridagi misolda ko'rsatilganidek, qatorlar darajasida "
"tezda guruh qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Group By` opsiyasidan foydalanishingiz "
"mumkin bo'lsa-da, qatorlar *va* ustunlar darajasida :guilabel:`Total` "
"sarlavhasi yonidagi plyus tugmasini (:guilabel:`➕`) bosib, so'ng **oldindan "
"sozlangan guruhlardan** birini ham tanlashingiz mumkin. Birortasini olib "
"tashlash uchun minus tugmasini (:guilabel:`➖`) bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:93
msgid ""
"Once you have added a group, you can add new ones on the opposite axis or "
"the newly created subgroups."
msgstr ""
"Guruh qo'shganingizdan so'ng, qarama-qarshi o'qda yoki yangi yaratilgan "
"kichik guruhlarda yangilarini qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:97
msgid ""
"You could further divide the measures on the previous Sales Analysis report "
"example by the :guilabel:`Salesperson` group at the level of columns and by "
"the :guilabel:`Order Date > Month` group on the :guilabel:`All / Saleable / "
"Office Furniture` product category."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi Sotuvlar tahlili hisoboti misolidagi o'lchovlarni ustunlar "
"darajasida :guilabel:`Salesperson` guruhi bo'yicha va :guilabel:`All / "
"Saleable / Office Furniture` mahsulot kategoriyasida :guilabel:`Order Date > "
"Month` guruhi bo'yicha yanada bo'lishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Adding multiple groups on the Sales Analysis report"
msgstr "Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotiga bir nechta guruh qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:105
msgid ""
"Switch the rows and columns' groups by clicking the flip axis button "
"(:guilabel:`⇄`)."
msgstr ""
"O'qlarni almashtirish tugmasini (:guilabel:`⇄`) bosish orqali qatorlar va "
"ustunlar guruhlarini almashtiring."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:106
msgid ""
"Click on a measure's label to sort the values by ascending (⏶) or descending "
"(⏷) order."
msgstr ""
"Qiymatlarni o'sish (⏶) yoki kamayish (⏷) tartibida saralash uchun o'lchov "
"yorlig'ini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:107
msgid ""
"Download a `.xlsx` version of the pivot by clicking the download button "
"(:guilabel:`⭳`)."
msgstr ""
"Yuklab olish tugmasini (:guilabel:`⭳`) bosish orqali pivotning `.xlsx` "
"versiyasini yuklab oling."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:112
msgid "Using the graph view"
msgstr "Grafik ko'rinishidan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:114
msgid "Three graphs are available: the bar, line, and pie charts."
msgstr "Uchta grafik mavjud: ustunli, chiziqli va doiraviy diagrammalar."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Bar charts** are used to show the distribution or a comparison of several "
"categories. They are especially useful as they can deal with larger data "
"sets."
msgstr ""
"**Ustunli diagrammalar** bir nechta kategoriyalarning taqsimlanishi yoki "
"taqqoslanishini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Ular katta hajmdagi "
"ma'lumotlar to'plamlari bilan ishlay olgani uchun ayniqsa foydali."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Line charts** are useful to show changing time series and trends over time."
msgstr ""
"**Chiziqli diagrammalar** o'zgaruvchan vaqt qatorlarini va vaqt davomidagi "
"tendensiyalarni ko'rsatish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Pie charts** are used to show the distribution or a comparison of a small "
"number of categories when they form a meaningful whole."
msgstr ""
"**Doiraviy diagrammalar** oz sonli kategoriyalar mazmunli bir butunni "
"tashkil etganda ularning taqsimlanishi yoki taqqoslanishini ko'rsatish uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:126
msgid "Bar chart"
msgstr "Ustunli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Viewing the Sales Analysis report as a bar chart"
msgstr "Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotini ustunli diagramma sifatida ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:131
msgid "Line chart"
msgstr "Chiziqli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Viewing the Sales Analysis report as a line chart"
msgstr "Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotini chiziqli diagramma sifatida ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:136
msgid "Pie chart"
msgstr "Doiraviy diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Viewing the Sales Analysis report as a pie chart"
msgstr "Sotuvlar tahlili hisobotini doiraviy diagramma sifatida ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:142
msgid ""
"For **bar** and **line** charts, you can use the stacked option when you "
"have at least two groups, which then appear on top of each other instead of "
"next to each other."
msgstr ""
"**Ustunli** va **chiziqli** diagrammalar uchun kamida ikkita guruhingiz "
"bo'lganda ustma-ust joylashtirish opsiyasidan foydalanishingiz mumkin, "
"shunda ular yonma-yon emas, balki bir-birining ustida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:147
msgid "Stacked bar chart"
msgstr "Ustma-ust ustunli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Stacked bar chart example"
msgstr "Ustma-ust ustunli diagramma misoli"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:152
msgid "Regular bar chart"
msgstr "Oddiy ustunli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Non-stacked bar chart example"
msgstr "Qatlamlanmagan ustunli diagramma namunasi"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:157
msgid "Stacked line chart"
msgstr "Qatlamli chiziqli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Stacked line chart example"
msgstr "Qatlamli chiziqli diagramma namunasi"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:162
#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:177
msgid "Regular line chart"
msgstr "Oddiy chiziqli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Non-stacked line chart example"
msgstr "Qatlamlanmagan chiziqli diagramma namunasi"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:167
msgid ""
"For **line** charts, you can use the cumulative option to sum values, which "
"is especially useful to show the change in growth over a time period."
msgstr ""
"**Chiziqli** diagrammalar uchun qiymatlarni jamlash maqsadida kumulyativ "
"opsiyadan foydalanishingiz mumkin, bu ayniqsa ma'lum vaqt oralig'idagi "
"o'sish o'zgarishini ko'rsatish uchun foydalidir."

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:172
msgid "Cumulative line chart"
msgstr "Kumulyativ chiziqli diagramma"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
msgid "Cumulative line chart example"
msgstr "Kumulyativ chiziqli diagramma namunasi"

#: ../../content/applications/essentials/reporting.rst:0
